#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals and reference targets preserved.
#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.rst:50
msgid ""
"The `./xinf-enterprise.sh` script is used to start the Nginx service and write the "
"Xinf service startup address to the configuration file."
msgstr "`./xinf-enterprise.sh` スクリプトは、Nginx サービスを開始し、Xinf サービスの開始アドレスを構成ファイルに書き込むために使用されます。"

#. Machine-translated prose; technical literals and reference targets preserved.
